{"id":"vod_jy_92212","vodId":"92212","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达SEED HD重制","name_cn":"机动战士高达SEED HD重制","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第48集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/69f48bca8f3133d409c715341f56491a.jpg"},"summary":"為迎接機動戰士鋼彈SEED十周年的2012年，官方於2011年8月26日啟動「HD Remaster Project（高畫質再製企劃）」，畫面尺寸比將從原先的4：3升級為16：9寬螢幕，線性PCM音源化，部分音樂採用混音版，局部畫面的替換和修正，各特效與背景的處理變更，並整合特別版三部作以及「DESTINY」的賽璐珞片，再編輯為全48話，收錄至Blu-ray共四卷BOX販售。相較於過去其他鋼彈作品的Remaster僅是單純的高畫質化，本作有著更全面的提升。「機動戰士鋼彈SEED HD」於2011年12月2","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-12 16:20:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b4xmXn2b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b68oZA9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eXDx4RWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/erkZOvEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRQD9We/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dyPlYn7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aOYl4Rpd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aQWJ42ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b2k4VNvd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eZ6OjoJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e0RqQBvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/elYQGVra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eXDx4Bke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dyPlYvVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/en5QKjRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/erkZONKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b4xmXJ1b/index.m3u8"},